### 8. ADMIN — LIST WITH SEARCH
### GET /api/media?search=dashboard
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}?search=dashboard


### ============================================
### 9. ADMIN — LIST FILTERED BY TYPE
### GET /api/media?fileType=image/png
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}?fileType=image/png


### ============================================
### 10. ADMIN — LIST SORTED BY SIZE DESC
### GET /api/media?sortBy=fileSize&sortOrder=desc
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}?sortBy=fileSize&sortOrder=desc


### ============================================
### 11. ADMIN — LIST (invalid sortBy, expect 400)
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}?sortBy=garbage


### ============================================
### 12. PUBLIC — GET MEDIA BY ID
### GET /api/media/:id
### ============================================
# @name getMedia
GET {{mediaUrl}}/{{createMedia.response.body.$.data.id}}


### ============================================
### 13. PUBLIC — GET MEDIA BY ID (nonexistent, expect 404)
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ============================================
### 14. PUBLIC — BULK GET BY IDS
### GET /api/media/bulk?ids=id1,id2
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}/bulk?ids={{createMedia.response.body.$.data.id}},{{createMedia2.response.body.$.data.id}}


### ============================================
### 15. ADMIN — CHECK USAGE (before attaching — 0 usages)
### GET /api/media/:id/usage
### Expected: 200 { data: { totalUsages: 0, usage: {...} } }
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}/{{createMedia.response.body.$.data.id}}/usage


### ============================================
### 16. ADMIN — ATTACH MEDIA AS PROJECT THUMBNAIL
### PUT /api/projects/:id
### Expected: 200 with thumbnail in response ✅
### ============================================
PUT {{projectsUrl}}/{{projectId1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mainThumbnailId": "{{createMedia.response.body.$.data.id}}"
}


### ============================================
### 17. PUBLIC — GET PROJECT BY SLUG (verify thumbnail attached)
### GET /api/projects/slug/portfolio-backend-api
### Expected: 200 with thumbnail object
### ============================================
GET {{projectsUrl}}/slug/portfolio-backend-api


### ============================================
### 18. ADMIN — CHECK USAGE AGAIN (now 1 project uses it)
### GET /api/media/:id/usage
### Expected: 200 { data: { totalUsages: 1, usage: { projects: [{...}] } } }
### ============================================
GET {{mediaUrl}}/{{createMedia.response.body.$.data.id}}/usage


### ============================================
### 19. ADMIN — ATTACH SECOND MEDIA TO A PROJECT SECTION
### PUT /api/projects/:id — add sections with mediaId
